    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectInRange? THEN\n\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\tDO MoveToLocation\n\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
